{"2376540": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Haunted Building", "steam_appid": 2376540, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376540/extras/278b04798f5e224745d3be37c5be6765.poster.avif?t=1763717551\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376540/extras/278b04798f5e224745d3be37c5be6765.webm?t=1763717551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376540/extras/278b04798f5e224745d3be37c5be6765.mp4?t=1763717551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every scene is a foreshadowing.<br>This is more than just a “ghost story.”<br>By unlocking different endings, your expectations will be overturned—twice—and your understanding of the truth will shift in completely unexpected ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>“The Haunted Building: The Locksmith on the First Floor”</strong> is a uniquely styled horror adventure set in the public housing block <i>Cheung Wing House</i>.<br>You play as <strong>Lee Shing</strong>, a young part-time security guard who becomes entangled in a series of unforgettable, nerve-wracking events inside this mysterious building.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story takes place in a residential block scheduled for demolition and redevelopment.<br>Because a handful of tenants still refuse to move out, your main duty is to collect their <i>relocation consent forms</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, you soon discover that strange things lurk in every corner.<br>Each remaining resident behaves in unsettling ways…<br>And rumors of terrifying spirits wandering the building only make Lee Shing’s investigation even more dangerous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set against the backdrop of 1990s Hong Kong, the game carries a strong nostalgic charm reminiscent of classic Hong Kong cinema, letting players relive an era filled with atmosphere and tension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376540/extras/ba2258166747427b3444281c9ebbee68.poster.avif?t=1763717551\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376540/extras/ba2258166747427b3444281c9ebbee68.webm?t=1763717551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376540/extras/ba2258166747427b3444281c9ebbee68.mp4?t=1763717551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About Unit One: The Locksmith</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first chapter focuses on a locksmith living on the first floor.<br>You must find a way—by any means necessary—to convince him to leave, and unravel the mysteries surrounding him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice you make shapes the story and leads to multiple endings.<br>Some truths require more than one playthrough to uncover.<br>Whether the tenants live or die, and whether Lee Shing can survive and see through the lies—all depends on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*The second unit “The Braided-Hair Girl” is currently in development, along with the series prequel <strong>“Urban Legend: Takeout.”</strong> Stay tuned!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376540/extras/58705b450bdb0624a1769a96ca42a5f8.poster.avif?t=1763717551\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376540/extras/58705b450bdb0624a1769a96ca42a5f8.webm?t=1763717551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376540/extras/58705b450bdb0624a1769a96ca42a5f8.mp4?t=1763717551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Hong Kong–style narrative that plays like binge-watching a suspense drama.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully voiced in Cantonese for an authentic local experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D-modeled Hong Kong public housing for richer atmosphere and immersion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A complete storyline with multiple endings—some truths can only be discovered through repeated playthroughs.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376540/extras/278b04798f5e224745d3be37c5be6765.poster.avif?t=1763717551\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376540/extras/278b04798f5e224745d3be37c5be6765.webm?t=1763717551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376540/extras/278b04798f5e224745d3be37c5be6765.mp4?t=1763717551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every scene is a foreshadowing.<br>This is more than just a “ghost story.”<br>By unlocking different endings, your expectations will be overturned—twice—and your understanding of the truth will shift in completely unexpected ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>“The Haunted Building: The Locksmith on the First Floor”</strong> is a uniquely styled horror adventure set in the public housing block <i>Cheung Wing House</i>.<br>You play as <strong>Lee Shing</strong>, a young part-time security guard who becomes entangled in a series of unforgettable, nerve-wracking events inside this mysterious building.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story takes place in a residential block scheduled for demolition and redevelopment.<br>Because a handful of tenants still refuse to move out, your main duty is to collect their <i>relocation consent forms</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, you soon discover that strange things lurk in every corner.<br>Each remaining resident behaves in unsettling ways…<br>And rumors of terrifying spirits wandering the building only make Lee Shing’s investigation even more dangerous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set against the backdrop of 1990s Hong Kong, the game carries a strong nostalgic charm reminiscent of classic Hong Kong cinema, letting players relive an era filled with atmosphere and tension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376540/extras/ba2258166747427b3444281c9ebbee68.poster.avif?t=1763717551\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376540/extras/ba2258166747427b3444281c9ebbee68.webm?t=1763717551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376540/extras/ba2258166747427b3444281c9ebbee68.mp4?t=1763717551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About Unit One: The Locksmith</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first chapter focuses on a locksmith living on the first floor.<br>You must find a way—by any means necessary—to convince him to leave, and unravel the mysteries surrounding him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice you make shapes the story and leads to multiple endings.<br>Some truths require more than one playthrough to uncover.<br>Whether the tenants live or die, and whether Lee Shing can survive and see through the lies—all depends on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*The second unit “The Braided-Hair Girl” is currently in development, along with the series prequel <strong>“Urban Legend: Takeout.”</strong> Stay tuned!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376540/extras/58705b450bdb0624a1769a96ca42a5f8.poster.avif?t=1763717551\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376540/extras/58705b450bdb0624a1769a96ca42a5f8.webm?t=1763717551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376540/extras/58705b450bdb0624a1769a96ca42a5f8.mp4?t=1763717551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Hong Kong–style narrative that plays like binge-watching a suspense drama.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully voiced in Cantonese for an authentic local experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D-modeled Hong Kong public housing for richer atmosphere and immersion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A complete storyline with multiple endings—some truths can only be discovered through repeated playthroughs.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A 90s Hong Kong public housing block hides twisted tenants, buried truths, and ghosts. As security guard Lee Shing, your choices shape the story and unlock multiple endings. A mystery full of foreshadowing—some truths can only be uncovered through repeated playthroughs.", "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Traditional Chinese<strong>*</strong>, English, Japanese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_a